          <change when="2020-06-22T12:51:52-04:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/gclaytor">Vote - AcceptText - iii.10 is giving a total of preceding entries. It should be encoded as follows: 10. [$m2 ((γίνονται)) ((δραχμαὶ)) .2]. I'm not entirely certain the dot after the closing bracket in the edition is actually supposed to be a dotted letter (regardless of what's on the papyrus).</change>
          <change when="2020-02-25T04:37:02-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/SusanFogarty">Submit - Col.3 there was no line 10. The numbering jumped from line 9 to 11. Edition has line 10: [(2. H.)/ (δραχμαὶ)  . . ]. Checked papyrus - there is just a partial letter on l.10. </change>
